[statement]
As `a-requirer-another-pending-name-could-require-waits`, with `kb`, which
nothing requires, depending on `w`: the walk for the preliminary choices
reaches `kb` through the condition of `kt`, and `w` waits its turn after
`v`, which goes to `gk`. Without `kt`, `kw` is installed first and
answers `v`.

[repository]
P:app
V:1
D:v w

P:kw
V:1
D:dep
p:v w=1

P:dep
V:1

P:kb
V:1
D:w

P:kt
V:1
i:app kb

P:gk
V:1
k:100
p:v

[request]
app

[answer apk-tools 3.0.9-r0]
install gk 1
install dep 1
install kw 1
install app 1
